## 5. Endpoint Inventory (DataTable)

The table below lists every registered API endpoint. Click **Latency (ms)** to sort. Method and Status columns use semantic badge chips — no colour-only encoding.

Columns divide whatever width the article is given instead of demanding their own, so this table fits the reading measure and only ever truncates a cell it cannot fit. Narrow the window, or switch the header to the readable measure, and the rows restack as labelled cards rather than scrolling sideways.

<DataTable
  columns={endpointColumns}
  rows={endpointRows}
  caption="API endpoint registry — sortable by latency"
  rowKey={(row) => row.method + row.path}
/>

---

## 6. Build History (compact + striped)

A compact, striped variant for dense audit data. Click **Version**, **Date**, or **Bundle (KB)** to sort. Version sorts by number, so `1.10.0` follows `1.9.0` rather than preceding it as a string compare would have it:

<DataTable
  columns={buildColumns}
  rows={buildRows}
  caption="Nightly build audit — bundle size and offline-safety check"
  rowKey={(row) => row.version}
  compact
  striped
/>
